{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01CbejUBB1PqCMokqsSWkZGS", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://qudt.org/vocab/unit/A-PER-M.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.aakash.ac.in/important-concepts/physics/magnetisation-and-magnetic-intensity\"}, {\"url\": \"https://dict.youdao.com/w/磁化强度\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.vedantu.com/physics/magnetization-magnetic-intensity\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.careers360.com/question-what-is-intensity-of-magnetisation\"}, {\"url\": \"https://digitalocean.wpcompress.com/blog/unit-of-magnetic-intensity-definition\"}, {\"url\": \"https://unacademy.com/content/magnetisation-and-magnetic-intensity/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.esaral.com/intensity-of-magnetization-magnetism-and-matter-class-12\"}, {\"url\": \"https://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/Magnetization\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:57:53.726Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "磁化强度 国际单位制 单位 安培每米", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01DKHRepeMk8pSzVK2gKfFcZ", "content": [{"title": "A PER M", "url": "https://qudt.org/vocab/unit/A-PER-M.html"}, {"title": "magnetisation and magnetic intensity", "url": "https://www.aakash.ac.in/important-concepts/physics/magnetisation-and-magnetic-intensity"}, {"title": "dict.youdao.com", "url": "https://dict.youdao.com/w/磁化强度"}, {"title": "magnetization magnetic intensity", "url": "https://www.vedantu.com/physics/magnetization-magnetic-intensity"}, {"title": "What is intensity of magnetisation?", "url": "https://www.careers360.com/question-what-is-intensity-of-magnetisation"}, {"title": "Unit Of Magnetic Intensity: Definition & Explanation", "url": "https://digitalocean.wpcompress.com/blog/unit-of-magnetic-intensity-definition"}, {"title": "Magnetisation and Magnetic Intensity", "url": "https://unacademy.com/content/magnetisation-and-magnetic-intensity/"}, {"title": "Intensity of Magnetization - Magnetism and Matter Class 12", "url": "https://www.esaral.com/intensity-of-magnetization-magnetism-and-matter-class-12"}, {"title": "qudt.org", "url": "https://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/Magnetization"}]}, "搜索结果显示，磁化强度的国际单位制单位是安培每米（A/m），符号为 A·m⁻¹。\n\n- **单位依据**：QUDT 词汇表把\"安培每米\"列为国际单位制（SI）单位，并把它与磁化强度这一量纲关联。该表还列出了 A/cm 作为另一个适用单位。ampere per metre(en) ampere por metro(pt)（其中收录了中文译名\"安培每米\"）。磁化强度的量纲页面列出了 A/m 作为适用单位。\n- **物理定义**：磁化强度可理解为单位体积内的磁偶极矩。磁矩与磁化物体体积之比即为磁化强度，即 I = M/V，其中 M 为磁化场作用下体系内的总磁矩。\n- **符号与含义**：中文资料中常用 M（或 J）表示磁化强度，它描述磁介质被磁化的强弱。\n\n由于磁化强度是磁矩除以体积，它的单位与磁场强度 H 的单位相同，均为 A/m。这一点是根据定义推出的，搜索结果中没有直接说明。"], "durationSeconds": 7.317656708, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01CbejUBB1PqCMokqsSWkZGS", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDXa4p1K86GG3GTrcwfa", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：安培每米（A/m，即 A·m⁻¹）。**\n\n磁化强度是单位体积里的磁矩。磁矩的单位是 A·m²，除以体积 m³，就得到 A/m。QUDT 的单位词表把“安培每米”列为国际单位制单位，并列为磁化强度的适用单位。\n\n共搜索 1 次。\n\nSources:\n- [QUDT：A PER M（安培每米）](https://qudt.org/vocab/unit/A-PER-M.html)\n- [QUDT：Magnetization 量纲页](https://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind/Magnetization)\n- [Vedantu：Magnetization and Magnetic Intensity](https://www.vedantu.com/physics/magnetization-magnetic-intensity)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1042, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4280, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1042}, "output_tokens": 271, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:57:57.296Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDXa4YsFmFh4zbNv8x9Q"}
